# The eyes: closed with no drums, half open with drums, open on a full beat or for 8 s after a new section. Half time ranks below the light beat
wait 8000
expect mutedrums 1
expect screen 1
expect eye 0
# ---- half time: half open
energy 20
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
wait 3000
expect mutedrums 0
expect level 4
wait 9000
expect eye 1
# ---- the light beat: half open
energy 40
wait 3000
expect level 2
expect eye 1
# ---- a full beat: open
energy 70
wait 3000
expect level 3
expect eye 2
# ---- level 0: no drums heard, closed
setpar 16 0
wait 400
expect eye 0
setpar 16 45
wait 400
expect eye 2
# ---- a new section on a light beat: open for 8 s, then half
energy 40
wait 3000
expect level 2
expect eye 1
tap EDIT
wait 2500
expect eye 2
wait 9000
expect eye 1
# ---- half time, likewise
energy 20
wait 3000
expect level 4
expect eye 1
# ---- muted: closed
press SEL
tap SEQ
release SEL
wait 400
expect mutedrums 1
expect eye 0
